        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Essence:</strong> Radiance &middot; <strong>Mutation:</strong> Flare Core</p><p><em>It burns white and it does not care what it is burning.</em></p><table><thead><tr><th>Depth</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>You shed <strong>bright light in a 20-foot radius</strong> at will. +1 item bonus to saves against blindness and dazzle.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Once per encounter, as a single action: creatures in a <strong>15-foot emanation</strong> must succeed at a Fortitude save against your class DC or be <strong>dazzled</strong> for 1 round.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>On a failed save they are <strong>blinded</strong> for 1 round instead. The flare deals <strong>fire damage equal to your level</strong> to creatures with light sensitivity or light blindness.</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>The emanation becomes <strong>30 feet</strong> and <strong>counteracts magical darkness</strong>. Once per day, it instead heals each ally within it for your level.</td></tr></tbody></table><p><em>Depth is this effect's badge. The whole Mutation switches off at Depth 3+ while the Carapace is broken.</em></p>"
        },
